* NTC10K: thermistor (CTN) 10 kohm at 25 degC, B = 3950 K (kisimavr)
* kisimavr - SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
*
* Pins: A B (KiCad symbol Device:Thermistor_NTC, Sim.Pins = 1=A 2=B)
* R(T) = R25 * exp(BETA * (1/T - 1/298.15)), T in kelvin;
* temperature T0 (degC) at t = 0, changing at RATE degC/s:
*   KiCad: Sim.Params = T0=20 RATE=100   (20 degC, +100 degC/s)
* Internal node "temp": the temperature, 1 V = 1 degC (to plot it).
* Self-heating is not modelled.
.subckt NTC10K A B params: R25=10k BETA=3950 T0=25 RATE=0
Btemp temp 0 V = {T0} + {RATE} * time
Rt temp 0 1meg
Bntc A B I = V(A,B) / ({R25} * exp({BETA} * (1 / (V(temp) + 273.15) - 1 / 298.15)))
.ends NTC10K
